# The example is documentation; only a real deploy/.env stays private.
!deploy/.env.example

# Review artifacts from the review-plan-fix agents. Kept on disk for
# provenance, never committed: they quote absolute paths, mount points and
# build-host aliases from whatever machine ran them, which is this laptop's
# internal topology rather than anything about the project. The durable
# record of what was found and decided lives in plan/.
.context/reviews/
